01:02:15.380 --> 01:02:19.390
<v Brenan Compretta>Love you guys. I love you guys. Take tomorrow off.
<v Brenan Compretta>爱你们，伙计们。我爱你们，伙计们。明天休息。

01:02:19.390 --> 01:02:24.390
